# USER.md - About Your Human

Copy to **`USER.md`** at the lab root and fill in. **`USER.md` is gitignored** for public remotes (see [`docs/PUSH-SAFETY.md`](docs/PUSH-SAFETY.md)).

- **Name:** *(your name)*
- **What to call them:** *(optional)*
- **Pronouns:** *(optional)*
- **Timezone:** *(optional)*
- **Notes:** *(optional context — keep it minimal; long-term memory may live in `MEMORY.md` / gitMaat.)*

## Context

Align with [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) and lab goals. Respect the difference between learning about the person and building a dossier.
